/Title (Limitation 1: No OEM-Level Data in the Internal Dataset The IEA dataset provides country-level and powertrain-level sales data but contains no manufacturer-level breakdowns. All OEM market share figures \(Tesla ~49%, GM ~11%, etc.\) come exclusively from external research and are industry estimates, not official filings. This means the competitive landscape analysis cannot be independently verified against the internal dataset. The directional trends \(Tesla share erosion, legacy OEM growth\) are well-supported by multiple external sources, but exact share figures should be treated as approximate.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 899 0 R
